<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <!--
      目標框架：net6.0 / net7.0 已於 2024 年結束支援，1.2.0 起移除。
      改為 netstandard2.0 / netstandard2.1 + net8.0 / net9.0 / net10.0，
      netstandard2.0 讓 .NET Framework 4.6.1+ 與仍停在 net6 / net7 的專案照樣吃得到。
      net6.0 / net7.0 reached end of life in 2024 and are dropped in 1.2.0; netstandard2.0
      keeps .NET Framework 4.6.1+ and any lingering net6 / net7 consumer working.
    -->
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;netstandard2.1;net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <!-- netstandard2.0 的預設語言版本是 C# 7.3，不明確指定就用不了可為 Null 參考型別的標註 -->
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.PageData</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.PageData</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.PageData</RootNamespace>
    <PackageVersion>1.2.0</PackageVersion>
    <Authors>ozakboy</Authors>

    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>

    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>

    <Features>strict</Features>
    <EnableNETAnalyzers>true</EnableNETAnalyzers>
    <AnalysisLevel>latest</AnalysisLevel>
    <EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>true</EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>

    <!-- 更詳細的套件描述 -->
    <Description>
      A lightweight and flexible pagination library for .NET applications.
      Supports List, IQueryable, and IEnumerable data sources with easy-to-use extension methods.
      Features:
      - Simple pagination implementation
      - Support for EF Core queries
      - Flexible page size configuration
      - Complete paging information
      - Data transformation support
      - Zero NuGet dependencies on every target framework
    </Description>

    <!-- 關鍵字標籤 -->
    <PackageTags>pagination;paging;ef-core;linq;data;netstandard;zero-dependency</PackageTags>

    <!-- 套件相關資訊 -->
    <Title>Ozakboy.PageData - Simple .NET Pagination Library</Title>
    <!-- PackageReleaseNotes 每次發版更新；與 CHANGELOG.md 的英文段落對齊 -->
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v1.2.0 — Retargeting release. No public API changes; upgrading needs no caller changes.

BREAKING (target frameworks only):
- Removed the net6.0 and net7.0 targets; both reached end of life in 2024. Projects still on
  net6.0 / net7.0 resolve the netstandard2.0 asset instead and keep working, no code changes needed.

ADDED:
- New targets: netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net9.0, net10.0. netstandard2.0 extends reach to
  .NET Framework 4.6.1+ and to any runtime implementing .NET Standard 2.0.

CHANGED:
- VPageData&lt;T&gt;.PageData and VPageData&lt;T&gt;.PageInfo are initialised to an empty list and an empty
  PageInfo instead of being left null. Only the parameterless constructor is affected; every other
  constructor already assigned both. Code that null-checked PageData after using the parameterless
  constructor now sees an empty page rather than null.
- Removed the Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub package reference. SourceLink ships in the SDK since
  .NET 8, so PublishRepositoryUrl + EmbedUntrackedSources give the same result without pulling in
  the Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git transitive dependency and its vulnerability advisory. Build-only change.

TECHNICAL:
- Zero NuGet dependencies on all five target frameworks.
- First release covered by an automated test suite (MSTest).

Full changelog: https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.PageData/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>

    <!-- 版權宣告 -->
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) 2024 ozakboy</Copyright>

    <!-- 專案連結 -->
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.PageData</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.PageData</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>

    <!--
      文件產生設定：不再把 DocumentationFile 釘死成單一檔名。
      多目標框架下五個 TFM 會同時寫同一個檔案，平行建置互相搶檔，
      打包出來的 XML 註解也只會剩最後一個 TFM 的版本。
      交給 SDK 依 TFM 各自輸出到 bin\&lt;Configuration&gt;\&lt;TFM&gt;\ 下即可。
    -->
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>

    <!-- 授權設定 -->
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE</PackageLicenseFile>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>

  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README_zh-TW.md"></None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    SourceLink：1.2.0 起移除 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件參照。
    .NET 8 起 SourceLink 已內建於 SDK，只要有 PublishRepositoryUrl + EmbedUntrackedSources
    就會產生完整的 repository 中繼資料與 PDB 來源對映。
    移除的動機是它的傳遞相依 Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git 帶有弱點公告，
    而它只在建置期用到、對消費者沒有價值；相依樹也因此保持全空。
    SourceLink is built into the SDK since .NET 8, so the package reference is gone.
  -->

</Project>
